                    <p class="primaryPostingHeader" style="margin-left: 50px;">
                        Job Posting:
                    Correctional Supervising Cook, CF - Salinas Valley State Prison (SVSP)
                    </p>

                </div>
                <div class="col col-twothirds jcHead-LeftPane">

                    <div class="col stateSealLogo">
                        <div>
                            
                            <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="State Seal Logo" />
